  "description": "A composable pipeline library for defining process flows with sequential execution, branching, try/catch handling, and mixed sync/async support. Each process step is encapsulated as a \"block,\" enabling modular and unit-testable workflows. The pipeline follows a two-rail system, breaking early on failure, with results wrapped in an Either monad for clear success/failure state management.",
